+/*  ChopGimp 3.32.0: Incrustation de motif (chopgimp:pattern-overlay), as
+ *  Photoshop's: mode, opacity, the pattern, angle, scale, « Lier au
+ *  calque », the offset (also moved by dragging on the image)
